  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EEF 24 25 - Equalities Programming in Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will enable the embassy to reconnect with local OPDs and draft a disability inclusion work plan that will identify areas where the UK can make the difference and share expertise with Argentina, with the aim of helping OPDs to make progress in the disability inclusion and rights agenda.</narrative>
  </description>
